⚡🇪🇬 Eni moves Denise West toward fast-track FID in Egypt. 

Eni, together with BP oil and EGPC, is targeting a final investment decision within the next few months for the Denise West gas discovery in Egypt's offshore Temsah concession, with first gas delivery expected in less than two years. The field was discovered in April 2026 during Eni's Mediterranean offshore campaign launched in October 2025 and it's estimated to hold around 2 TFC of gas and 130 million BBL of condensate in place. This comes as Egypt aims to place itself as a major gas player in the region.

